cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PhysioCAT: physiological delay-banded cross-attention for subject-independent cuffless blood pressure estimation from ECG and PPG"
message: "Please cite the associated manuscript and this software release."
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-29
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/shangyr/PhysioCAT"
url: "https://github.com/shangyr/PhysioCAT"
abstract: "PhysioCAT encodes the ECG-leading peripheral pulse-arrival relation as a fixed delay-banded cross-attention prior, aligns reciprocal attention on the same ECG-PPG edges, and weights interactions by pairwise local signal quality."
keywords:
  - cuffless blood pressure estimation
  - electrocardiography
  - photoplethysmography
  - cross-attention
  - multimodal learning
  - reproducible research
